long_description    IMSProg is a free software suite for CH341A/CH347T based chip programmers \
                    with a graphical Qt interface. With IMSProg you can read, verify, \
                    program, and erase I2C, SPI, SPI NOR, MicroWire, and Dataflash EEPROM chips. \
                    Includes the main programmer GUI, chip database editor, and database update utility.

